<title>SPAIN: Repsol posts 5.6 pct drop in net profit to Sept.</title>
<headline>Repsol posts 5.6 pct drop in net profit to Sept.</headline>
<dateline>MADRID 1996-11-12</dateline>
<text>
<p>Results for Spanish energy group Repsol in billions of pesetas, unless stated:</p>
<p> Net attibutable profit	     86.98     vs     92.15</p>
<p> Operating profit		    143.04     vs    168.49</p>
<p> Operating income		  1,980.94     vs  1,915.15</p>
<p> Extraordinary profit		  0.892    vs     (4.04)</p>
<p> Net cash flow			   183.93   vs   189.00</p>
<p> Earnings per share (pesetas)	289.92   vs   307.16</p>
<p> Cash flow per share (pesetas)     613.09   vs   629.99</p>
<p> Shareholders' funds		   717.82   vs   658.04</p>
<p> Provisions				103.53   vs    95.82</p>
<p> Debt (medium/long-term)	     287.89   vs   221.08</p>
<p> Debt (short-term)		     163.67   vs    92.73</p>
